⚠️ C003/C006-এর token-গুলো UUID pattern মেনে চললেও persistent session থাকার প্রমাণ নেই; দুই operation-এর ৮০টি করে log সরাসরি missing-session rejection দেখায়। Source সেই অবস্থায় deliberate 400 দেয়, backend result call-এর আগে। Captured traffic-এ কোনো registrationToken creation সফল হয়নি; TAN/testresult requests teleTAN creation-এরও আগে হয়েছে। অতএব `VALID_REJECTED` এখানে state না বোঝা oracle-এর false positive—IMPL বা ENV নয়। Evidence: `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/exchanges.jsonl:2`, `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/exchanges.jsonl:82`; `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/spec.original.json:57`, `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/spec.original.json:105`; `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/compose.log:250`, `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/compose.log:532`; `08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/ExternalTanController.java:108`, `08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/ExternalTanController.java:154`, `08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/ExternalTestStateController.java:102`, `08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/ExternalTestStateController.java:149`; `09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/case_summary.json:31`।

⚠️ C004-এর ১০০টি response 201; checker object/ref header-কে স্পষ্টভাবে uncheckable করে। Unit হলো coverage diagnostic, header model-এর আদর্শ serialization নির্ধারণ নয়। C005-এর ১০০টি 404-এ capture সম্পূর্ণ কিন্তু body খালি; controller ও ResponseEntity<Void> handler সেটিই ইচ্ছাকৃতভাবে করে। তাই C005-এর response content schema সরানোই repair; আলাদা code defect-এর প্রমাণ নেই, BOTH candidate নয়। Evidence: `08_experiments/tools/conformance.py:327`, `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/spec.original.json:170`, `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/compose.log:1398`; `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/exchanges.jsonl:331`, `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/spec.original.json:232`, `08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/InternalTanController.java:120`, `08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/VerificationExceptionHandler.java:93`। C001-এর probe header ও GET / → 400 evidence: `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/exchanges.jsonl:1`, `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/compose.log:382`।

Root CSV-তে RC01 probe, RC02 missing required fields, RC03 omitted conditional patterns, RC04 invalid HTTP, RC05 state oracle, RC06 header coverage এবং RC07 unwanted response-body schema আলাদা; C002 একাধিক root বহন করে। Fix sites কেবল spec/test। Evidence: `08_experiments/E2_labelling/cwa-verification_root_causes_codex.csv:2`, `08_experiments/E2_labelling/cwa-verification_root_causes_codex.csv:3`, `08_experiments/E2_labelling/cwa-verification_root_causes_codex.csv:4`, `08_experiments/E2_labelling/cwa-verification_root_causes_codex.csv:5`, `08_experiments/E2_labelling/cwa-verification_root_causes_codex.csv:6`, `08_experiments/E2_labelling/cwa-verification_root_causes_codex.csv:7`, `08_experiments/E2_labelling/cwa-verification_root_causes_codex.csv:8`। নতুন proposed `T-ORACLE-STATE` মানে schema-valid input থেকেই business-state validity ধরে নেওয়া। `T-ORACLE-COVERAGE`-এর body-only উদাহরণকে এখানে unsupported parameter serialization পর্যন্ত বিস্তৃত করার প্রস্তাব; `T-PROBE` ও mixed C002-এর leaf `T-GEN-INVALID-HTTP` §10.5-এর pending নাম। কোনো নতুন L2-কে অনুমোদিত ধরে নেওয়া হয়নি (`08_experiments/tools/conformance.py:327`, `08_experiments/tools/conformance.py:438`, `08_experiments/R1_triage_codebook.md:233`; `09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/case_labels.json:1`)।

সীমা ও খোলা প্রশ্ন: blinding বজায় রেখে labels_A এবং pilot_results-এর RESULTS report খোলা হয়নি; বাধ্যতামূলক board log পড়া হয়েছে, label evidence হিসেবে ব্যবহৃত হয়নি। কোনো external code/SUT চালানো হয়নি; task-এর নিষিদ্ধ harness/tools write করা হয়নি; own Python ও read-only replay ব্যবহৃত হয়েছে (scope: `09_collab/tasks/T18.md:13`, `09_collab/tasks/T18.md:32`; execution record: `09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/validation.json:1`)। Log-এ ৭১টি UnicodeEncodeError আছে; তাই এই ফল কেবল captured ৪৩০ exchange-এর, সম্পূর্ণ emitted traffic-এর নয়। Log corroboration operation/category-ভিত্তিক; unique request identity join নয়। দুটি firewall exception-কে সাতটি raw invalid-header case-এর সঙ্গে জোর করে join করিনি (`08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/compose.log:439`, `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/compose.log:966`, `08_experiments/E1_pilot/runs/cwa-verification/20261114T084828Z_batch_118863_baseline_NONE_p0_s1/compose.log:1248`; `09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/log_locations.json:1`)। Missing cwa-testresult-server-এর জন্য এই ছয় fingerprint-এ ENV evidence পাওয়া যায়নি; source/log-এ observed rejection backend call-এর আগেই হয় (`08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/ExternalTanController.java:118`, `08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/ExternalTanController.java:154`, `08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/ExternalTestStateController.java:111`, `08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/src/main/java/app/coronawarn/verification/controller/ExternalTestStateController.java:149`; `09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/log_locations.json:1`)। Supervisor-এর খোলা সিদ্ধান্ত: proposed state-oracle L2 ও parameter-coverage scope-এর নাম গ্রহণ করবেন কি না; successful stateful workflow-এর failure এই baseline থেকে নির্ণয় করা যায় না (`09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/case_summary.json:31`)।

যাচাই: exact item/count coverage, ৪৩০ case aggregation, reciprocal root membership, সব evidence locator, ≤৩০-word rationale ও unchanged input hashes PASS। পূর্ণ audit: `09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/validation.json:1`; deliverable freeze ও SHA-256: `09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/freeze.json:1`।

diff --git a/research/09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/audit.py b/research/09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/audit.py
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..8a347b03dd23d2cb8ca449f63cb0f4af1a4e21cf
--- /dev/null
+++ b/research/09_collab/logs/T18_scratch/audit.py
@@ -0,0 +1,125 @@
+"""Audit every captured T18 diagnostic without retaining credential values."""
+import collections
+import hashlib
+import json
+from pathlib import Path
+import re
+import sys
+
+sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent))
+from replay import OUT, ROOT, RUN, SOURCE, save
+
+
+def main():
+    xs = [json.loads(s) for s in (RUN / 'exchanges.jsonl').read_text().splitlines()]
+    mapping = json.loads((OUT / 'exchange_map.json').read_text())
+    cases = []
+    reasons = collections.Counter()
+    for iid, lines in mapping.items():
+        for n in lines:
+            x = xs[n - 1]
+            req, resp = x['request'], x['response']
+            invalid_headers = {k: sorted({ord(c) for c in value
+                                         if (ord(c) < 32 and c != '\t') or ord(c) == 127})
+                               for k, value in req['headers'].items()}
+            invalid_headers = {k: v for k, v in invalid_headers.items() if v}
+            record = {'item_id': iid, 'exchange_line': n,
+                      'invalid_header_control_codepoints': invalid_headers}
+            text = req.get('body', {}).get('text', '')
+            body = json.loads(text) if text else None
+            if iid == 'C001':
+                assert 'x-schemathesis-probe' in req['headers']
+                assert 'x-schemathesis-probe-null' in invalid_headers
+                label, category, roots = 'TEST', 'capability_probe', ['RC01']
+            elif iid == 'C002':
+                assert isinstance(body, dict)
+                missing = [k for k in ('key', 'keyType') if k not in body]
+                pattern = []
+                if body.get('keyType') == 'GUID' and isinstance(body.get('key'), str):
+                    if not re.fullmatch('[0-9A-Fa-f]{64}', body['key']):
+                        pattern.append('GUID_key')
+                if 'keyDob' in body and not re.fullmatch('[XxA-Fa-f0-9][A-Fa-f0-9]{63}', body['keyDob']):
+                    pattern.append('keyDob')
+                if body.get('keyType') == 'TELETAN' and isinstance(body.get('key'), str):
+                    # Invalid alphabet fails independently of configured length and database state.
+                    if any(c not in '23456789ABCDEFGHJKMNPQRSTUVWXYZ' for c in body['key']):
+                        pattern.append('TELETAN_key_alphabet')
+                record.update({'missing_required_fields': missing,
+                               'source_pattern_violations': pattern})
+                if invalid_headers:
+                    assert resp['body']['size'] == 435
+                    assert '<html' in resp['body']['text'].lower()
+                    label, category, roots = 'TEST', 'invalid_HTTP_header', ['RC04']
+                else:
+                    assert not resp['body']['text'] and (missing or pattern)
+                    label, category = 'SPEC', 'missing_request_constraints'
+                    roots = (['RC02'] if missing else []) + (['RC03'] if pattern else [])
+                    reasons.update('missing_' + k for k in missing)
+                    reasons.update(pattern)
+            elif iid in ('C003', 'C006'):
+                assert not invalid_headers
+                assert re.fullmatch('[a-f0-9]{8}-[a-f0-9]{4}-4[a-f0-9]{3}-[89aAbB][a-f0-9]{3}-[a-f0-9]{12}',
+                                    body['registrationToken'])
+                assert not resp['body']['text']
+                assert req['headers'].get('cwa-fake') != '1'
+                label, category, roots = 'TEST', 'unestablished_registration_token_state', ['RC05']
+            elif iid == 'C004':
+                assert resp['status'] == 201
+                assert 'authorization' in req['headers']
+                label, category, roots = 'TEST', 'unsupported_object_header_validation', ['RC06']
+            elif iid == 'C005':
+                assert resp['status'] == 404 and not resp['body']['text']
+                assert not resp['body'].get('truncated') and not resp['body'].get('decode_error')
+                label, category, roots = 'SPEC', 'unwanted_error_body_schema', ['RC07']
+            proposed = {'capability_probe': 'T-PROBE',
+                        'invalid_HTTP_header': 'T-GEN-INVALID-HTTP',
+                        'unestablished_registration_token_state': 'T-ORACLE-STATE',
+                        'unsupported_object_header_validation': 'T-ORACLE-COVERAGE'}.get(category, '')
+            record.update({'L1': label, 'category': category, 'root_cause_ids': roots,
+                           'L2': ('S-REQ-LOOSE' if iid == 'C002' else 'S-RESP-MISSING') if label == 'SPEC' else '',
+                           'proposed_L2': proposed})
+            cases.append(record)
+    logs = (RUN / 'compose.log').read_text().splitlines()
+    phrases = {
+        'unknown_registration_token_tan': 'VerificationAppSession not found for the registration token',
+        'unknown_registration_token_testresult': 'Returning the test result for the registration token failed',
+        'invalid_tan': 'No Tan found or Tan is invalid',
+        'teletan_generated': 'The teleTAN is generated.',
+        'invalid_GUID_syntax': 'The hashed guid has no valid pattern',
+        'invalid_TELETAN_syntax': 'The teleTAN is not valid to the syntax constraints.',
+        'capture_encoding_error': 'UnicodeEncodeError:',
+        'firewall_error': 'RequestRejectedException:',
+    }
+    locations = {name: [n for n, line in enumerate(logs, 1) if phrase in line]
+                 for name, phrase in phrases.items()}
+    assert len(locations['unknown_registration_token_tan']) == 80
+    assert len(locations['unknown_registration_token_testresult']) == 80
+    assert len(locations['invalid_tan']) == 100
+    assert len(locations['teletan_generated']) == 100
+    # These are operation/category corroborations, not unique request/log identity joins.
+    locations['join_scope'] = 'operation/category counts and source flow; no exact exchange identity join'
+    locations['backend_error_matches'] = {
+        phrase: [n for n, line in enumerate(logs, 1) if phrase in line]
+        for phrase in ['UnknownHostException', 'ConnectException', 'FeignException']}
+    save('log_locations.json', locations)
+    save('case_labels.json', cases)
+    summary = {'status': 'PASS', 'diagnostic_cases': len(cases),
+               'L1_cases': dict(collections.Counter(c['L1'] for c in cases)),
+               'C002_source_constraint_reasons_overlapping': dict(reasons),
+               'C002_leaf_counts': dict(collections.Counter(c['L1'] for c in cases if c['item_id'] == 'C002')),
+               'root_case_memberships': dict(collections.Counter(r for c in cases for r in c['root_cause_ids'])),
+               'all_C003_C006_requests_precede_teletan_creation': max(mapping['C003'] + mapping['C006']) < min(mapping['C004']),
+               'successful_registrationToken_responses': sum(x['request']['path'] == '/version/v1/registrationToken' and 200 <= x['response']['status'] < 300 for x in xs),
+               'external_execution': False}
+    save('case_summary.json', summary)
+    evidence = [RUN / f for f in ['spec.original.json', 'generator-input.json', 'exchanges.jsonl', 'compose.log']]
+    evidence += list(SOURCE.rglob('*.java'))
+    evidence += [ROOT / f for f in ['08_experiments/tools/conformance.py', '08_experiments/tools/specmut.py',
+                                  '08_experiments/R1_triage_codebook.md', '09_collab/tasks/T18.md',
+                                  '08_experiments/E2_labelling/cwa-verification_baseline_s1_blind.csv']]
+    save('input_sha256.json', {str(p.relative_to(ROOT)): hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest() for p in evidence})
+    print(json.dumps(summary, indent=2))
+
+
+if __name__ == '__main__':
+    main()
